      - "2³² mod 6 = 4, so the top 4 raw values out of 4,294,967,296 are rejected"
    result: "One number from 1 to 6, each with probability 1/6"
    link: "/tools/random-number-generator/?min=1&max=6&count=1#tool"
  - title: "Lottery-style draw: 6 numbers from 1 to 49"
