  - q: "Can I use this for a raffle or giveaway?"
    a: "Yes. Number the entries, set the range to match, untick duplicates and draw as many winners as you need. For names instead of numbers, use the random name picker."
  - q: "Are my numbers sent anywhere?"
    a: "No. The numbers are generated in your browser and are not sent to or stored on a server."
